//RS /// D-NARG-D2: Walk one default expression exhaustively and replace each
//RS /// declaration-local reference with its compiler-private slot name. The
//RS /// replacement is a slot read, never a supplied argument AST, so side effects
//RS /// in a written argument cannot be duplicated by a default.
